WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.718
- So I hear you seem to find
a piano wherever you travel,

00:00:02.718 --> 00:00:04.251
is this a thing you love to do?

00:00:04.251 --> 00:00:06.630
- Well, I've never met
a piano I didn't like.

00:00:06.630 --> 00:00:07.950
- I like that.
- Yeah.

00:00:07.950 --> 00:00:09.105
- That's 'cause you're good at it.

00:00:09.105 --> 00:00:11.447
- Every once in a while I'll be somewhere

00:00:11.447 --> 00:00:13.809
and there'll be a piano somewhere.

00:00:13.809 --> 00:00:14.642
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:14.642 --> 00:00:15.475
- [Craig] And I'll just
pop up and sit down.

00:00:15.475 --> 00:00:16.308
Yeah. Yeah.

00:00:16.308 --> 00:00:17.141
- [Kelly] Especially, like the bar

00:00:17.141 --> 00:00:17.974
at the hotel you're
staying at or something,

00:00:17.974 --> 00:00:18.960
I feel like they always have one.

00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:20.100
- [Craig] Yeah. That's happened for sure.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:21.453
I think that was in Austin.

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:23.820
- Austin, Texas?
- Yes. Yeah.

00:00:23.820 --> 00:00:25.530
- Oh man, they probably loved it.

00:00:25.530 --> 00:00:26.363
- Oh yeah. Yeah.

00:00:26.363 --> 00:00:28.045
They came around and we
were, you know, being silly.

00:00:28.045 --> 00:00:29.074
- [Kelly] It's like
music city there, yeah.

00:00:29.074 --> 00:00:30.090
- We just did a whole little
show right there. Yeah.

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.590
- What's like a- What's the best-

00:00:31.590 --> 00:00:32.850
Do you have like the
most memorable moment,

00:00:32.850 --> 00:00:33.683
something's happened like that?

00:00:33.683 --> 00:00:35.561
You just sat down and
something cool happened?

00:00:35.561 --> 00:00:39.930
- Oh (chuckles), I was at this party.

00:00:39.930 --> 00:00:42.270
and Mick Jagger was there.

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:43.103
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:43.103 --> 00:00:45.212
- Not- And it wasn't like Mick
Jagger happened to be there.

00:00:45.212 --> 00:00:47.950
It was a party, we were
doing this movie Get On Up.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:50.025
- Yeah.
- And they had a party at this

00:00:50.025 --> 00:00:53.610
this guy's house somewhere,
we were in Mississippi,

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:54.990
and Mick Jagger's one of the producers,

00:00:54.990 --> 00:00:57.420
so he was, but then he got around,

00:00:57.420 --> 00:00:59.400
the piano was just singing
tunes with us. Yeah.

00:00:59.400 --> 00:01:00.233
- That's crazy.

00:01:00.233 --> 00:01:01.470
- It was amazing.

00:01:01.470 --> 00:01:02.550
I wish I had that picture for you.

00:01:02.550 --> 00:01:05.340
- Oh my god. I swear I
would've laughed while singing.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.420
Like, what is- why is-

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:08.670
- Oh, it was, yeah, it was just, it was-

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:09.503
- I love moments like that,
- I was on a cloud.

00:01:09.503 --> 00:01:10.590
- it's like a movie.
- Yeah.

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:11.700
- Yeah.
- I was on a cloud.

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:12.663
- That's so cool.

